        "raw": "[quote=\"Raccoonoo\"]\n\nIt has been confirmed that the Oversized Villain Pack has all the stand alone villains there will ever be in it, so, no. Sadly OblivAeon will not have any regular villains in it.&nbsp;\n\n[/quote]\n\nis this accurate? I thought the word was the oversize villain pack has all the stand alone villains that won&#39;t come with their own oversized villain card. But on the Kickstarter they&#39;ve given us the contents of Oblivean and there will be the three villain decks ( aeon men, scions, and Oblivean ) and the mission deck. So no there most likely won&#39;t be any stand alone villains in it.&nbsp;\n",
