        "created_at": "2016-03-06T04:53:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Kickstarter\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Kickstarter:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p><b><i>Sentinels of the Multiverse: OblivAeon</i></b> &nbsp;is the final expansion to the Sentinels of the Multiverse line of games, and what an expansion it will be! The game will contain:</p>\n<ul><li>Five familiar heroes (more on them below in the \"Characters\" section) who are coming to this last defense of the Multiverse!</li><li>A \"Mission\" deck full of quests the heroes embark on to gain allies and tools to aid them in the conflict!</li><li>Several villain decks that work together in different ways to make up the OblivAeon scenario, including decks for Scions, Aeon Men, and OblivAeon as well!</li><li>Two environment decks and a comic book!&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/gtgames/sentinels-of-the-multiverse-oblivaeon/posts/1487593\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Unlocked from Stretch Goals</a>&nbsp;by YOU on DAY ONE!!\n</li></ul></blockquote>\n</aside>\n\nThat is ALL it will contain. &nbsp;",
